
$SUB ADVAN1 TRANS2

$PK

HILL = THETA(5)
T50 = THETA(6)
PMA = ga + ageInWeeks

TVCL = THETA(1) * (bodyweight/1)**THETA(3) * (54/creatinine)**THETA(4) *  ((PMA**HILL)/(PMA**HILL + T50**HILL))
CL = TVCL * EXP(ETA(1))

TVV = THETA(2) * bodyweight
V = TVV


S1 = V / 1000


$THETA
0.273 FIX; 1 CL
0.628 FIX; 2 V
0.438 FIX ; 3 bodyweight on CL
0.473 FIX ; 4 creatinine on CL
3.54 FIX ; 5 HILL
46.4 FIX ; 6 T50
1980 FIX ; 7 Additive residual error, in ug/l
0.236 FIX ; 8 Proportional residual error
